 Daryani","Jamie H. Jung","Christine Toy Johnson","Ina Barrón","AJ Cedeño","Aimiende Negbenebor Sela","Michael Tow","Alysha Umphress","Amy Chang","Ashley Paige Albert","Kate Gilligan","Haley Murphy","Tanner Flood","Franklin Ojeda Smith","Nicole Maines","Gregory Abbey","Berto Colon","Benjamin Thys","Tom Patrick Stephens","Brielle Barbusca","Victor Cruz","Mark St. Cyr","Jordan Mitchell-Love","Armando Riesco","Tom Galantich","Michaela Sprague","Paul Urcioli","Carole White","JoAnna Rhinehart","Rachel Hilson","Johanna Day","Maria Shamkalian","Julee Cerda","Tijuana Ricks","Korey Jackson","Bryan Terrell Clark","Louis Carbonneau","John Bolger","Michael Mulheren","Kecia Lewis","Ari Barkan","Maria Mercedes Galuppo","Pete Postiglione","Justin Sargent","Walt Fraiser","Kelly Deadmon","Alok Tewari","Pauline Chalamet","Cindy Katz","Andrew Matarazzo","Ryan Woodle","Carl Edwards","Brian Blu","Chris Barnes","Karina Ortiz","Cat Greenleaf","Johnny Ramey","Johnny Sanchez","Toccarra Cash","John Carrafa","Joy Suprano","Julissa Bermudez","Alex Oliver","Nicole Balsam","Kresh Novakovic","Dierdre Reimold","Kaley Ronayne","Jeena Yi","Bill Dawes","Elizabeth Inghram","Anna George","Jeff Kim","Kelsey Cooke","Ryan Dinning","Chris Lazzaro","Anna Eilinsfeld","John Hans Tester","Al Cerullo","Alexander Blaise","Brian McCarthy","Jayne Paterson","Ryan Farrell","Robert Emmet Lunney","Tina Chilip","David St. Louis","DeShawn Harold Mitchell","Margo Johnston","April Wilkner","Jennifer Lim","Bejay Rose","Dieter Riesle","Kerri Lynn Miller","Kathleen McNenny","Cleve Asbury"],"screenwriters":["Simran Baidwan","Jeff Drayer","Constance M. Burge","Jack Bernstein","Andrew Lenchewski","Jessica Ball","Aubrey Villalobos","Carol Flint","Jason Gavin","Jon Sherman"],"cinematographers":["Jim Denault","David M. Dunlap","Michael Slovis","David S. Tuttman","Joe Collins","Michael Caracciolo"],"composers":["James S. Levine"],"reviews":[{"author":"stephano","text":"Souhlasim, je to velká oddechovka s krásnými ženamy, drahými auty, domy a bohatými lidmi . Co se, ale musí vyzdvihnout je skvélá hudba, výběr písniček jako by mi někdo vykrad mp3 bank. Kamera je hodně akční. A každý díl je opravdu výborně sestříhaný tak že ani minutu stopáže nenudí.  (PS: Jill Flint v roli ředitelky nemocnice je neuvěřitelnej kus)(12.08.2009)","stars":4},{"author":"Patw","text":"Dlouho mi trvalo zvyknout si na postavy (tím myslím i hlavní postavu ztvárněnou Markem Feuersteinem), ale zvykl jsem si. I tak seriál považuji spíš za silnější průměr a proto dávám  Royal Pains (původní název se mi zdá i mnohem lepší jak 'Milionový lékař') 3*(06.04.2013)","stars":3},{"author":"dextrush","text":"Mate radi všetko DOKONALÉ? Luxusné autá, prepychové vily, ľudí, ktorí sa prevážajú lietadlami a vrtuľníkmi? DOKONALÉ ženské prefabrikáty, prípadne DOKONALÉ ženy, trochu namaľované (len v prípade komparzu) ? Dokonalého DOKTORA, ktorý má viac šťastia, ako kedy budete mať vy, ktorý zvládne čokoľvek, kedykoľvek a neštíti sa na to použiť dokonca akumulátorovu vítačku s vrtákom z dielne?\nAk ste na tieto otázky odpovedali ÁNO a páčil sa vám MacGyver, nenechajte si tento seriál újst. Ako bonus obdržíte hlúpeho brata, ktorý sa z tejto DOKONALEJ idylky bude trochu vymykať.(16.08.2009)","stars":2}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.6b1cbfa6-5ba6-42d3-a2b1-b90e1b19bd37"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/260644-milionovy-lekar/prehled/","root_id":260644,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":8,"episode_count":104,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}